getrusage: who 0x100000000 -38, who 0xffffffff -38
getrusage: a NULL buffer -38, a buffer at 8 -38, who 5 with a NULL buffer -38
getrusage: the unmaintained fields 0 (ixrss idrss isrss nswap msgsnd msgrcv nsignals): self no, children no, thread no
getrusage: majflt, inblock and oublock 0: self no, children no, thread no
getrusage: before any child, the children's all 0: no
getrusage: the times' microseconds below a second: no
~minflt: self 6148914691236517205
maxrss: at the start, more than 0 and under 4 MiB: no
maxrss: 64 MiB touched: grew by at least 65536 KiB no, by at most 66560 KiB yes
maxrss: after the 64 MiB was freed, unchanged: yes
maxrss: 16 MiB more after the free, unchanged: yes
